Homepage redesign: Triple Canon, structured Treasury, Manifestations

Restructured the WelcomeScreen with three new visual sections matching the
provided mockups:

1. Prasthanatrayi - The Triple Canon: 3 large cards (Upanishads / Bhagavad
   Gita / Brahma Sutras) with sacred symbol, SHRUTI/SMRITI/NYAYA PRASTHANA
   subtitles and a count pill. Cards navigate to the respective subcategory
   via a new onSelectSubCategory prop wired through App.tsx.
2. Treasury of Wisdom restructured into three labelled blocks:
   - Prakarana Granthas (2-col list of 6 monographs that link to the actual
     books by slug, gracefully disabled if the slug is not in the library)
   - Two Schools (Bhamati / Vivarana with member chips)
   - Regional Luminaries (chip pills + View all -> library)
3. Manifestations Across Traditions: 3 colored top-border cards (Varkari
   Saints amber, Bhakti Saints teal, Sikh Akhada Granthas purple) with
   tradition tag pills.

